  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "What is the GRE exam?",
      "a": "GRE is a standardized test widely accepted for MS, MBA and other Masters programs worldwide."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which courses accept GRE scores?",
      "a": "Most MS programs in Engineering, CS, Data Science, Analytics and many MBA programs accept GRE."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is GRE mandatory for all universities?",
      "a": "No. Some universities list GRE as optional or not required, especially in Europe."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I get admission with a low GRE score?",
      "a": "Yes. With the right university selection and strong profile, good options are possible."
    },
    {
      "q": "How does Career Laksh help GRE students?",
      "a": "Profile evaluation, university shortlisting, SOP/LOR support, application and documentation guidance."
